Cell["\<\
Do we need to consider significant agglomerations such as London, Manchester, \
Birmingham and Glasgow?
If there is a gradient of temperatures N/S or E/W then taking these cities \
into account in the weighted average may affect the results.
Is there a gradient of temperature north/south, east/west?\
\>", "Text",
