Cell["\<\
Test for normality for  temperature distributions through the year 2022. 
Both the North and South dataset deviates significantly from the identity \
lines, therefore the data is not normally distributed.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9269978480964622`*^9, 3.926997874077364*^9}, {
  3.926997965989231*^9, 3.9269979975356426`*^9}, {3.926998775997952*^9, 
