Cell["\<\
Kruskal-Wallis test to compare the medians of the two datasets:

- The null hypothesis (H0) is that the median temperature is equal across the \
east and west groups, or that the difference between the medians is zero.
- The alternative hypothesis (H1) is that the median temperature of the East \
group differs from the  median temperature of the West group.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.92736861101766*^9, 3.927368616990814*^9}, {
  3.927368677020197*^9, 3.9273688872693787`*^9}, {3.927372088128416*^9, 
  3.927372101869562*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c3c63a20-39a3-0d43-a927-\
e95a034e6fc1"],

