Cell["\<\
There is a gradient of temperature N/S and E/W across the UK that is \
statistically significant, therefore in the calculation of the temperature \
weighted average for the UK I will include cities north and south and east \
and west.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.927601737129442*^9, 
  3.9276018133883076`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8165ebfb-dd42-334a-8099-\
2c5e9ab8b1d7"]
}, Closed]]
}, Open  ]],

