Cell["\<\
A weighted average temperature is between 2 and 3.5% higher than the mean \
temperature. This is driven mostly by the higher population density in the \
South with London in particular.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9270002128632984`*^9, 3.927000323083128*^9}, {
  3.927609364401398*^9, 3.92760940616877*^9}, {3.9277724288412113`*^9, 
