Cell["\<\
To calculate the actual temperature weighted average, let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
use a 5km grid of the UK to define more representative areas for London, \
Birmingham, Manchester, Leeds and Glasgow.
Largest urban agglomerations \
https://www.statista.com/statistics/294645/population-of-selected-cities-in-\
united-kingdom-uk/\
\>", "Text",
