Cell["\<\
Key fields are Total demand, Transformation, Electricity generation and Heat \
generation.
Calculation: total demand - transformation + heat generation.
Essentially removing electricity generation which is already accounted for in \
electricity demand\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.927953040153221*^9, 
  3.927953079451164*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f754497d-1e1b-3543-b1e9-\
4be77274e93e"],

